        Size = UDim2.new(0, 2, 0, 12),
        Position = UDim2.new(0, 0, 0.5, 0),
        AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0, 0.5),
        BorderSizePixel = 0,
        ZIndex = 7,
    }, btn)
    corner(bar, 2)

